# Hooks and prove.sh are bash. A CRLF line ending makes them fail with "bad interpreter",
# which is the first thing README.md tells you to check when the Stop gate never fires.
# Global git config only protects this machine; this file protects every clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
